[table][tr][th]Month[/th][th]God[/th][th]Domain[/th][th]Plane[/th][th]Race[/th][/tr][tr][td]1[/td][td]Kaelthor[/td][td]Nature, Temptest[/td][td]Outer Planes[/td][td]Elves[/td][/tr][tr][td]2[/td][td]Aurelius[/td][td]Wisdom, Justice[/td][td]Mechanus[/td][td]Gnomes[/td][/tr][tr][td]3[/td][td]Vesper[/td][td]Peace, Twilight[/td][td]Outer Planes[/td][td]Genasi[/td][/tr][tr][td]4[/td][td]Aloria[/td][td]Light, Life[/td][td]Elysium[/td][td]Humans[/td][/tr][tr][td]5[/td][td]Tyra[/td][td]Hunt, Nature[/td][td]Beastlands[/td][td]Dragonborn[/td][/tr][tr][td]6[/td][td]Raven Queen[/td][td]Death, Grave[/td][td]Shadowfell[/td][td]Shadow Elves[/td][/tr][tr][td]7[/td][td]Thalkis[/td][td]Forge, Arcana[/td][td]Outer Planes[/td][td]Dwarves[/td][/tr][tr][td]8[/td][td]Crassian[/td][td]Wealth, Fortune[/td][td]Outer Planes[/td][td]Halflings[/td][/tr][tr][td]9[/td][td]Vorn[/td][td]War, Conquest[/td][td]Nine Hells[/td][td]Half-Orcs[/td][/tr][tr][td]10[/td][td]Lolth[/td][td]Trickery, War[/td][td]Abyss[/td][td]Drow[/td][/tr][/table]
[p][b]Order of creation[/b][/p]
[ol]
-    Nature first — Kaelthor makes the raw world from chaos
-    Order imposed — Aurelius tames it with law
-    Peace between — Vesper sets boundaries so things don't clash
-    Life awakens — Aloria brings light and reproduction
-    Hunger drives — Tyra gives creatures the instinct to survive
-    Death completes — Raven Queen closes the life cycle
-    Knowledge granted — Thalkis gives mortals craft and magic
-    Civilization forms — Crassian invents trade and economy
-    Conflict arises — Vorn gives the means to wage war
- Cunning prevails — Lolth provides wit as the final tool to avoid or win conflict
[/ol]
[p][/p]
